    "notes": {
        "6ab809d6-dd1b-4988-945d-3847a89d869d": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 400,
            "width": 736,
            "height": 256,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption: a permanent board\n\nA trigger property cannot take a value from the flow, so New Item watches a board that must already exist. Create a board named \"E2E Miro - permanent board (do not delete)\" in the E2E team and replace **E2E_PERMANENT_BOARD_ID** with its Board ID (the part after /board/ in its URL) in the New Item trigger, in Create Sticky Note and in Delete Item.\n\nThe trigger records the board on its first check, so the sticky note is added after a 2-minute Wait. Do not remove it. Delete Item removes the note again."
        }
    }
